###
### PERMISSIONS ENDPOINTS ###
### Get all permissions
GET {{api}}/permissions/
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Get a specific permission
GET {{api}}/permissions/1

###

### Create a new permission
POST {{api}}/permissions/
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "read:users",
  "description": "Permission to read users"
}

###

### Update an existing permission (PATCH)
PATCH {{api}}/permissions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "read:all_users",
  "description": "Permission to read all users"
}

###

### Delete a permission
DELETE {{api}}/permissions/1

###
### ROLE-PERMISSION ASSIGNMENT ENDPOINTS ###
### Get permissions for a role by role name
GET {{api}}/permissions/admin/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
###

### Get roles for a permission by permission name
GET {{api}}/permissions/role/read:users/roles

###

### Assign a permission to a role
POST {{api}}/permissions/roles/assign?permission_name=delete:user_roles&role_name=admin
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
###

### Remove a permission from a role
POST {{api}}/permissions/roles/remove?permission_name=delete:user_roles&role_name=admin
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

